# ── MetaManager local hub → cloud database ──────────────────────────────────
# 1. Make a COPY of this file named exactly  .env  (in this same folder).
# 2. In Render → your service → Environment, reveal DATABASE_URL and copy its value.
# 3. Paste it after the = below (replace the placeholder), save the file.
# 4. Double-click  start-hub.bat  to run the hub. It will write to this cloud DB,
#    and your Render dashboard (https://metamanager-hub.onrender.com/) reads the same one.
#
# Point each AdsPower extension's Hub URL at  http://127.0.0.1:5051/api/ingest
# (localhost bypasses the AdsPower proxy, which is why it works and the cloud URL didn't).

DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host.neon.tech/dbname?sslmode=require
